UPSTREAM DATA SOURCES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Index values are derived from public price surfaces. SOURCES.md records, per
source, the endpoint, the IOSCO input tier, the robots/ToS basis relied upon, and
the date it was last reviewed. Two sources are themselves redistributors: ECB
reference rates reach this project via frankfurter.dev, and hyperscaler catalog
prices via the gpuhunt package.

Nothing in this file, and nothing in DATA-TERMS.md, purports to grant rights in
any upstream source's own data beyond what that source's terms permit.

